WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.250
- [Mark] All right, Victoria.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.590
Victoria, where are you from originally?

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:35.590
Where'd you grow up?

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.180
- I was born in Las Vegas,

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.710
but when I was nine I left

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.910
and went to Arkansas

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.510
and my mom moved out there

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.150
and I lived back and forth
between Vegas and Arkansas.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.660
- [Mark] Between your mom and dad?

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.600
- Yeah.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.400
- [Mark] And how was your childhood?

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.070
- I come from a Russian household,

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.193
so Russians tend to be really violent.

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:07.313
And there was a lot of physical abuse,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.653
a little bit of sexual abuse.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.800
Some memories I have is

00:01:17.639 --> 00:01:20.700
when I was about 13 my uncle shot at me.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:23.700
And when I was about 16,

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:28.423
my mom fractured my face with
a pipe when she was drunk.

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.780
- [Mark] Sounds pretty rough.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.052
- Yeah, I just stuck with that.

00:01:37.052 --> 00:01:40.002
- [Mark] What kind of kid
were you in high school?

00:01:40.002 --> 00:01:43.161
What kind of kid were you in high school?

00:01:43.161 --> 00:01:45.461
- I got into the punk
rock scene pretty early.

00:01:46.782 --> 00:01:47.615
So,

00:01:47.615 --> 00:01:49.883
my grades were not good.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.057
By the time I was in high school

00:01:53.057 --> 00:01:55.010
I was already shooting heroin

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.523
and living on the streets.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.770
So, they would send me home

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.660
