00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:06.980
- [Mark] How far did
you go in high school?

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:07.813
- Sophomore.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.147
But I got my GED later.

00:02:11.147 --> 00:02:11.980
- [Mark] Okay.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.440
And where did you go from there?

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:16.750
Living on the street?

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:19.770
- I continued to live on the street,

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:24.770
and then when I was 18 I was
arrested on a big drug bust.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.090
I got raided

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:30.223
and I did some time in jail.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:34.563
And I got out and I went
to rehab the first time.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:36.470
And

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.060
I had a person in there that I met.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.900
